    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nitpick is an open-ended cooperative multiplayer adventure where you try to run a business with up to 8 friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large world:</strong>\u00a0Hunt and explore 36 square kilometers of Quebec's underdeveloped region.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Business Management</strong>: Manage a business with your friends as your employees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Substances:</strong> Use illicit and legal substances to manage your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tax-Filling Mechanics:</strong>\u00a0Fill out proper tax returns as a business owner or risk the penalties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items:</strong>\u00a0Make, find, share, buy, or sell a variety of items to progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distortion</strong>: Your perspective of the game world cannot be trusted.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nitpick is an open-ended cooperative multiplayer adventure where you try to run a business with up to 8 friends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large world:</strong>\u00a0Hunt and explore 36 square kilometers of Quebec's underdeveloped region.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Business Management</strong>: Manage a business with your friends as your employees.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Substances:</strong> Use illicit and legal substances to manage your character.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tax-Filling Mechanics:</strong>\u00a0Fill out proper tax returns as a business owner or risk the penalties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Items:</strong>\u00a0Make, find, share, buy, or sell a variety of items to progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Distortion</strong>: Your perspective of the game world cannot be trusted.</p></li></ul>",
